	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"マクロスΔの人気パイロット・ミラージュのスーパージークフリードが1/72可変モデルでキット化！",
			"• ハヤテ機と面に戦場を駆け抜けた、スーパーパックを装備したミラージュ機が専用カラーリングで登場！",
			"• スーパーパックは一部成形色をミラージュ機に仕様変更！頭部付近の装甲を新規パーツで再現！",
			"• ファイター、ガウォーク、バトロイド形態への三段変形機構搭載。"
		],
		"en": [
			"Macross Delta's popular pilot Mirage Super Siegfried is now a 1/72 variable model kit!",
			"• The Mirage machine equipped with a super pack that ran through the battlefield just like Hayate's machine is now available in a special coloring!",
			"• Some of the molding colors of the Super Pack have been changed to the Mirage machine! Reproduce the armor near the head with new parts!",
			"• Equipped with a three-stage transformation mechanism to fighter, gerwalk, and battroid forms."
		]
	},
